      "__id__": 39
    },
    "_lineHeight": 35,
    "_string": "<color=#d3b8ff>    By continuing I acknowledge that Happy Donut may store and process my data in accordance with the <color=#ffffff><u><on click='privacyHandler'>Privacy Policy</on></u></color>.\n\n   I have read and agree to the <color=#ffffff><u><on click='termHandler'>Terms and Conditions</on></u></color>, which establish a contract and include a class action waiver and arbitration clause.</color>",
